  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1840\">\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1773\"><strong data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1771\">Normal Result (46,XY):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1840\">\n<li data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1840\">\n<p data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1840\">No detectable structural or numerical chromosomal abnormality.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1866\"><strong data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1864\">Abnormal Result:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<li data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1989\">\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1989\">May reveal <strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1935\">balanced translocations, inversions, or mosaicism</strong>, relevant to <strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1986\">infertility, RPL, or genetic risk</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2071\">\n<p data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2071\">Requires <strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2070\">genetic counseling and possible couple testing (female partner)</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2179\">\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2179\">Results must be <strong data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2169\">reported in ISCN (International System for Human Cytogenomic Nomenclature)</strong> format.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
